  "id": 77,
  "Specification": "A performance-optimized extension of the EWD998 termination detection algorithm designed for simulation and benchmarking. It uses feature flags to toggle specific protocol behaviors, tracks termination latency using TLC state markers, and outputs execution statistics to CSV.",
