  "DivisionNotes": [
    "OperatorDefNames partitioned: ActionDefNames (PassTokenOpts, SystemOpts), StatePredicate (InitSim, AtTerminationDetected), TemporalProperty (SpecOpts), ValueDef (FeatureFlags, AtTermination, Features, Nodes).",
    "InitSim placed in StatePredicate because it is a Boolean conjunction over unprimed variables that constrains initial states; SpecOpts uses InitSim as part of its initial-state predicate.",
    "AtTermination placed in ValueDef because it produces a non-Boolean TLCSet/TLCGet effect rather than a pure state predicate.",
    "TemporalNesting is false: SpecOpts uses [][...]_vars with no nested temporal operators.",
    "All FunctionConstructors are ByDomain form ([n \\in Node |-> ...]).",
    "VerificationTools = [TLC] since this spec is intended for TLC simulation/generation mode (ASSUME TLCGet(\"config\").mode = \"generate\")."
